chapter.v:
	then he 

	 who presents his offering to the Lord shall bring a grain offering of one-tenth of an ephah of fine flour mixed with one-fourth of a hin of oil;
 [Num. 28:7,] [Lev. 2:1; 6:14 28:5] [Ex. 29:40; Lev. 23:13 h Lev. 14:10; Num.]

	Or for 

	 a ram you shall prepare as a grain offering two-tenths of an ephah of fine flour mixed with one-third of a hin of oil;
 [Num. 28:12,]

	then shall 

	 be offered with the young bull a grain offering of three-tenths of an ephah of fine flour mixed with half a hin of oil;
 [Num. 28:12,]
